r\n    _Detector(\"PII\", \"card_like_number\",\r\n              re.compile(r\"(?<![0-9A-Za-z])(?:\\d[ \\-]?){13,19}(?![0-9A-Za-z])\"),\r\n              \"[REDACTED:PII]\",\r\n              \"order reference 2026 is recorded in the quarterly ledger\"),\r\n)\r\n\r\nDETECTORS = tuple(_DETECTORS)\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
